.Ic __attribute__((stack_protect)) ,
which any of the others guards too.
A function declared
.Ic __attribute__((no_stack_protector))
has none.
The guarded locals lie right under the canary.
.Dv __SSP__ ,
.Dv __SSP_STRONG__ ,
.Dv __SSP_ALL__
or
.Dv __SSP_EXPLICIT__
is defined as with
.Xr gcc 1 .
