Where the guard is: by default the thread's,
.Li %fs:40
on x86-64 and
.Li %gs:20
on i386; at offset
.Ar n
or symbol
.Ar sym
in segment
.Cm fs
or
.Cm gs
\(em Linux's is
.Li %gs:__ref_stack_chk_guard
\(em or with
.Cm global ,
