.It Fl ffreestanding , Fl fhosted
Whether the program is for a freestanding implementation:
.Dv __STDC_HOSTED__
is 0 under the first, and by default 1.
A call of a library function cc expands in line, such as a small
.Fn memcpy ,
keeps the function's meaning, so the
.Fl fno-builtin
.Xr gcc 1
implies is in effect already.
.It Fl fvisibility Ns = Ns Cm default Ns | Ns Cm hidden Ns | Ns Cm protected Ns | Ns Cm internal
Give each definition that names no visibility of its own, and gets none
