.It Fl mno-80387 , Fl m80387 , Fl mno-fp-ret-in-387 , Fl mfp-ret-in-387
Make no x87 instruction, or no result in
.Li %st0 ;
a function that would need one \(em a
.Ic long double ,
or on i386 any floating point \(em is refused.
.Xr gcc 1
refuses the same on x86-64, as Linux builds; on i386 it calls a library
